<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="未来Compass"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Mirai Compass"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="碧蓝航线9周年主题曲"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MARiA"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="メイリア"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="水桥舞"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="美依礼芽"/><amll:meta key="album" value="未来Compass"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Mirai Compass - Single"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3370527183"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="004U3rhd0PCwaP"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="657090584"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1893518611"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPZ922601883"/><amll:meta key="Arranger" value="Miyazaki Ayumi"/><amll:meta key="Co-Producer" value="根本健一"/><amll:meta key="Composer" value="Miyazaki Ayumi"/><amll:meta key="Composer" value="宮崎步"/><amll:meta key="Lyrics" value="MARiA"/><amll:meta key="Lyrics" value="栗海溧"/><amll:meta key="Lyrics" value="赵竟"/><amll:meta key="Mastering Engineer" value="佐々直美"/><amll:meta key="Mastering Engineer" value="Naomi Sasa"/><amll:meta key="Mixing Engineer" value="競紀行"/><amll:meta key="Producer" value="佐藤龍"/><amll:meta key="Vocals" value="MARiA"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="68000793"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ranhengzhang"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">每一天就像沉入深海中呼吸</text><text for="L2">多想跃入碧蓝海浪里嬉戏 游来游去</text><text for="L3">世界总给我跌倒和爬起的练习</text><text for="L4">学不会人鱼流畅的轨迹</text><text for="L5">命运中的选择或许没有答案</text><text for="L6">正确的道路虽不明了仍 向前奔跑</text><text for="L7">反正人生总会有遗憾</text><text for="L8">跌跌撞撞我也要奔向 光的方向</text><text for="L9">抬头看 同一片天空下 你也在仰望</text><text for="L10">我们点亮了希望 冲向远方 长出翅膀</text><text for="L11">放弃念头突然停下 忽然飘散像空中雪花</text><text for="L12">答案 早在心中 的乐章</text><text for="L13">像过山车的极速穿越风和光</text><text for="L14">剧情总在意外的地方闪耀 闪闪发亮</text><text for="L15">故事的结局为何总是来得匆忙</text><text for="L16">一瞬的灿烂值得永远珍藏</text><text for="L17">憧憬 或许比失去的少</text><text for="L18">但我愿与你共绘 美好时光</text><text for="L19">那未来的画卷 有你一起同往</text><text for="L20">相信微不足道的渴望</text><text for="L21">每次遗憾的告别 都让我更勇敢</text><text for="L22">我要向远方 的彼岸 <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(远方 的彼岸)</span></text><text for="L23">抬头看 同一片天空下 你也在仰望</text><text for="L24">我们点亮了希望 冲向远方 长出翅膀</text><text for="L25">这样世界就变得明亮 连悲伤都闪烁动人光芒</text><text for="L26">只要与你并肩 向远方</text><text for="L27">心跳动的方向 不偏差</text><text for="L28">此刻正连接 未来航向</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Miyazaki Ayumi</songwriter><songwriter>宮崎步</songwriter><songwriter>MARiA</songwriter><songwriter>栗海溧</songwriter><songwriter>赵竟</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="13.660" end="13.870" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">na</span><span begin="13.870" end="14.050" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">n</span> <span begin="14.050" end="14.180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">da</span> <span begin="14.180" end="14.370" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ka</span> <span begin="14.370" end="14.700" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">i ki</span> <span begin="14.700" end="14.990" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">no</span> <span begin="14.990" end="15.200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">tsu</span> <span begin="15.200" end="15.380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ma</span> <span begin="15.380" end="15.700" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ru</span> <span begin="15.700" end="16.050" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ma i</span> <span begin="16.050" end="16.540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ni chi</span> <span begin="16.